      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERFECTLY (4) was a last start winner (30.34) from Box 8 at The Meadows. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. WHY NOT IRIS (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Traralgon behind Tommy The Hood (24.08) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Will give a great sight again. RUNWAY BLUE (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (26.52) in a Grade 5 FIN at this track. Solid record here winning two races. Comes through a solid form race last start. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. BLUE TROMBONE (8) drops in trip and should be in the mix.",
